<header id="title-block-header" class="quarto-title-block default">
<div class="quarto-title">
<h1 class="title">desugar</h1>
</div>
<div class="quarto-title-meta">
</div>

</header>


<p>The structural desugaring contract (bd-7gqr148v, GH #846): what the qmd
reader turns into a <code>Table</code>, <code>DefinitionList</code> or <code>Figure</code> must come out
the same when an lmd cell builds the shape from nodes, writes it inside
a fragment, or reads it back from JSON.</p>
